{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Koi Suru Boukun","Being in love with your not-gay senpai isn't easy, but being in love with your not-gay, homophobic and (to top it off) tyrannical senpai can be hell! And that's something Tetsuhiro Morinaga can relate to... especially now that he's had a taste of the forbidden fruit!"],"ja":["恋する暴君",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-8634","ids":{"shikimori":8634,"mal":8634,"anilist":8634,"kodik":"serial-20835"},"kodikIds":["serial-33665","serial-20835"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-33665":"2021-04-01T21:11:38Z","serial-20835":"2020-01-07T19:06:59Z"},"title":"Тиран, который влюбился","originalTitle":"Koisuru Boukun","alt":"The Tyrant Falls In Love 恋する暴君","description":"] Тэцухиро Моринаги , давно и безнадёжно влюблённого в своего университетского сэмпая-гомофоба Тацуми , человека привлекательного и умного, но с весьма сложным характером. Хотя, даже к таким влюблённым судьба бывает благосклонна. И по стечению обстоятельств Тэцухиро выпадает шанс наконец воплотить свои мечты и фантазии в реальность... хотя бы раз.","year":2010,"type":"OVA","genres":["Комедия","яой"],"rating":6.88,"popularity":9832,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://st.kp.yandex.net/images/film_big/581910.jpg","width":349,"height":500},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/c2a12f1a6ed0961ae171cfdc4b841a343bb8f951.jpg","width":900,"height":530}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-674","dubId":"674","label":"Люб. Одноголосый","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-33665","translationId":"674","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/813019/e23d947ce1f6b4df19268dbecfb731f7/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":fa